| # | case (owner · file) | suite | rate · composition | pin |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | kumitate · `scripts/kimi-census.mjs` | 43 | 8/10 = 80 % · 10 kill-aimed | `83016d45…` |
| 2 | kagi · `corpus/surface-census.sh` | 16 | 8/10 = 80 % · 10 kill-aimed | `275d8294…` |
